      "sourceFiles": ["src/pages/apps/minitools/index.astro", "src/components/MiniToolsPage.astro", "src/components/MiniToolsIsland.astro", "src/components/MiniToolsNotch.astro", "src/components/MiniToolsIcon.astro", "src/data/apps/minitools.ts", "src/layouts/ProposalLayout.astro"],
      "theme": "EN/ES and dark initial default unchanged; explicit saved light/dark choices override it through independent site-theme:minitools preference. Shared semantic page tokens; fixed black island. Tidal wallpaper uses #091d29 base, #146b79 teal and #e99381 coral highlight; selected/hovered activity rail uses #164653f2/#1b5060f2.",
      "provenance": "Real red app icon at public/images/minitools/app-icon.png is unchanged. Current public/images/minitools/tidal-wallpaper.png preserves the wave composition in petroleum/coral colors across the stage and notch illustration. Original generated blue-wallpaper.png, its embedded provenance and .impeccable/blue-wallpaper.prompt.txt remain historical source material. UI and copy remain semantic; the island is a disclosed web simulation, not a native screenshot.",
      "interaction": "One native-derived shell retains four states: closed 198x33px, activity 282x33px, concurrent music 246px plus 24px bubble, expanded 760px overall/375px height/35px inset. Compact open adds music 440x213px with 58px art/44px note, timer 400x103px with 40px controls/29px orange time, and pinned completion alert 450x127px with orange 25px title/21px mobile. Hover intent 120ms/exit 220ms; focus preserves controls, click/Enter/touch pins, close/Escape restores the compact opener outside alerts. No width interpolation; pointerdown cancels pending hover and the first-click origin guard prevents revealed Close from consuming the opening gesture. Native pressed-gesture blocking is the reference. Music is silent simulation; gesture-opt-in synthetic alarm tones stop on dismiss/repeat/off/reset/page exit or after 10 seconds; three-second test timer provided.",
      "review": "Compact hover/alert refinement is scoped SHIP in .impeccable/review/minitools/hover-alert-verdict.md with hover-alert-packet.md. Root actual-mouse and separate Enter flows passed, plus 1440px/390px, EN/ES, themes, zero overflow and no console warnings/errors. Sole P2 fixed by .timer-alert>div>span; reported 13-route build and diff check passed at 23:14. Reviewer source/capture inspection supports mobile orange title correction; replacement desktop JPEG crops the rail, so desktop alert verification is root-attributed. Light capture predates note correction; mobile music is viewport-cropped. No listening test. Earlier reviews remain historical; single-comp gates remain unverified. No publication."
